Kind: ablation
Issue: #963
Takes out: the one module a chora loads, the one it was given: it fetches and loads its whole class from bootstrap, as a class server does, and picks the named module out of it.  It holds chora_absent's code, whose DT_INIT says so; and since chora_probe is on the disk and in no pool of the bundle (#964), the card's chora finds no module of its name among those it loaded, and ends.
Run: --iommu intel --entry 68 600 -smp 4
Expect: chora_absent: WRONG -- loaded, and no chora is ever told to load it

diff --git a/uros/src/servers/chora/chora.c b/uros/src/servers/chora/chora.c
